cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SignTurk, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SignTurk: real-time Turkish Sign Language recognition in the browser"
abstract: >-
  SignTurk recognises the 226 signs of the AUTSL dataset from a webcam in the
  browser, turns the signs the user approves into Turkish sentences and plays
  signs back on a 3D avatar. It was built as a team graduation project at
  Eastern Mediterranean University in 2025-2026, supervised by Asst. Prof.
  Dr. Cem Ergün, and was named an Outstanding Graduation Project.
